+
+// (globalObject, callee, values, count, cache). The case where the callee is the function the site knows; the other (a second
+// function, through the megamorphic construction cache) goes to the operation. Free: rax, r10, r9, and r11 for the allocator's
+// scratch.
+void generateFrontEndCreateThisWithProperties(CCallHelpers& jit)
